<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brierley confirms 7.4 pct Coles stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brierley confirms 7.4 pct Coles stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd said in a a report on Friday that its Australian unit Australian Consolidated Investments Ltd (ACIL) has a 7.4 percent stake in the nation's largest retailer Coles Myer Ltd.</p>
<p>ACIL has spent about A$364.8 million on its Coles stake, said Brierley in a information memorandum for shareholders of John Fairfax Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Brierley last month acquired a 19.9 percent in Fairfax and is seeking Fairfax shareholder approval to raise its stake in the newspaper group to 24.96 percent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
